#. ~ Description of gun "antique musket"
#. ~ Description of "antique musket"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/black_powder.json
msgid ""
"An antique design, this smoothbore long arm would look more at home on a "
"pre-1850's battlefield than in your hands in the Cataclysm.  Its loading may "
"be slow, but it does not require brass casings to fire, and is theoretically "
"sustainable to fire.  Range and accuracy are hampered by lack of rifling, but"
" this time-tested design is plenty lethal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
