#. ~ Description of "remediator defense anchor"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
msgid ""
"A combined harness and armor system designed to protect the wearer from the "
"effects of normality decay.  It mounts a 5-point anchor, attachment points "
"for a kinetic mantle and several pockets and straps for the rest of your "
"gear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "remediator defense anchor"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
msgid "Demolition pouches"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "remediator defense anchor"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
msgid "Straps for carrying a Lewis gun."
msgstr ""

