#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
msgid "Lewis gun Mk.III XE"
msgid_plural "Lewis gun Mk.III XEs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Lewis gun Mk.III XE"
#. ~ Description of "Lewis gun Mk.III XE"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A British light machine gun from the first world war, slightly modernized and modified for hip and shoulder firing while standing.  Its design is somehow stable even under extreme normality distortion and thus its found a new life with lab remediation teams.\n"
"\n"
"Your training allows you to effectively wield this weapon in close quarters, and you perform melee attacks with it at 33% of its base attack speed."
msgstr ""

