msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "crossbow sling"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/unique_items.json
msgid ""
"A complex sling designed to carry a repeating crossbow while keeping it ready"
" for use.  The sling is designed to be worn across the torso and can be "
"quickly adjusted to bring the crossbow to bear."
msgstr ""

