#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You are but a child again, fighting over the dinner's remains with your "
"brothers and sisters.  There were times for mirth and playfulness, but this "
"is not one of those - the time nears when the smallest will be cast aside, "
"and you're all terrified of being chosen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You soar above the plains, but the pickings are slim today.  The shadows "
"lengthen already, and you turn homewards with a flick of your wings, steeling"
" yourself to the disappointed cries of your chicks and another hungry night."
"  You must do better tomorrow, lest this year's brood will be lost too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You long for the skies, to watch the tiny problems of the ground disappear "
"below you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You remember feeling less attached to the ground.  What are you missing?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You need more if you are to fly South before the cold comes.  Much more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Is your beak strong enough?  Your feathers long?  No, you need more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You need enough bird primer and catalyst in your system while you are "
"sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bird_failure>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You won't be able to change without enough catalyst, the right primer and "
"being asleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You prowl the forest with your nestmates in search of prey - you're a strong "
"brood with bright feathers and sharp talons, but fortune seems to elude you "
"lately.  You take them towards the edge of the forest, where the air always "
"smells of smoke, and sneak up on a pack of monkeys with too-colorful fur "
"sitting on a fallen tree and chattering amongst themselves.  The smallest "
"notices you and waves excitedly, just before you pounce."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream of blood on your talons, and the air catching your feathers as you "
"try to balance on your struggling prey.  It feels almost like a game, "
"something you'd have played in a previous life.  Lost in thought you almost "
"miss the moment when the threshing grows still, until your brothers' screech "
"brings you back to the present - time to eat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Slow.  Too slow.  Slower than prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You'll never wet your talons at this rate.  You need to become better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Scenes of a chase, claws, blood on the leaves flash before your eyes.  You "
"need more to truly understand it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Not a care in the world, only the hunt.  How you wish you were that far gone "
"already."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<raptor_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You need enough raptor primer and catalyst in your system while you are "
"sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_dream>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<wings_bird_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "<bird_dream>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "<raptor_dream>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You are desperate to stop your disgusting ape hands from pulling out handfuls"
" of your beautiful feathers, but they move on their own accord.  You manage "
"to hold one of the useless things between your talons, and bring your beak "
"down on it…Just a dream.  Still, food for thought."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arm_feathers_success>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You wake to a sudden itch in your arms, and you shake them vigorously.  To "
"your painful surprise a new cover of long, strong feathers broke the surface,"
" bloody dead skin and plumage falling on the ground."
msgstr ""
